    "detailed_description": "<i>THIS GAME IS IN DEVELOPMENT. SCREENSHOTS, OTHER TEASERS, AND DESCRIPTIONS WILL BE SUBJECT TO CHANGE AS PROGRESS IS MADE.</i><br><br>High Velocity Arena blends an arena shooter, hero shooter, and twin-stick shooter into fast-paced multiplayer experience unlike any other. Pick between five classes, aka \u201cPolygons\u201d, each of which sport an entirely unique arsenal of weapons, abilities, and modifications. Battle across a multitude maps set anywhere from a golf course to Mars, and triumph over your opponents!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features HVA Has</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 100 different possible loadouts for any playstyle<br></li><li> Many maps with multiple different gamemodes<br></li><li> Accounts are a username and password - nothing more<br></li><li> A developer that cares about his game and its community</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features HVA Doesn\u2019t Have</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Skill-based matchmaking in Casual<br></li><li> Microtransactions<br></li><li> Ads<br></li><li> Data harvesting</li></ul>",
